-- [AI生成] v32 -> v33：分享链接解析两表（L4-P1）——parse_dictionary 解析字典路由 + share_link 分享链接采集与状态。
CREATE TABLE parse_dictionary (
    id INTEGER NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    source TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,
    parse_fun TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',
    ai_parse_fun TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',
    status INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1
);

CREATE TABLE share_link (
    id INTEGER NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    source TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',
    link TEXT NOT NULL,
    title TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',
    clear_text TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',
    step_images TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',
    image_url TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',
    parse_state INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
    dish_id INTEGER REFERENCES dish(id) ON DELETE SET NULL,
    status INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,
    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,
    parsed_at INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0
);

CREATE INDEX idx_share_link_state_time ON share_link(parse_state, created_at DESC);
CREATE INDEX idx_share_link_dish ON share_link(dish_id);
